  "summary": "<p>President Donald J. Trump’s decisive enforcement of America’s immigration laws is producing real results for hardworking families — including the nation’s 46 million renters. Rents are falling sharply across the country for the first time in years as the record surge in illegal immigration has been reversed. Rents in major metro areas have dropped significantly [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/06/president-trump-drives-down-rents-by-ending-open-borders-disaster/\">President Trump Drives Down Rents by Ending Open Borders Disaster</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
